WEBVTT

00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:11,070
say there are over-the-culture

00:00:11,070 --> 00:00:15,250
and antihistamines that are beneficial for breast cancer.

00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:19,750
So yes, and over-the-culture antihistamine medication

00:00:19,750 --> 00:00:22,950
has been shown to help people with breast cancer

00:00:22,950 --> 00:00:25,250
or the real reason is because histamines

00:00:25,250 --> 00:00:27,190
can be a problem with all cancers,

00:00:27,190 --> 00:00:30,510
but certainly have been shown through multiple studies

00:00:30,510 --> 00:00:34,390
to be a problem for those with breast cancer.

00:00:34,390 --> 00:00:40,690
So antihistamines taken just on a daily basis

00:00:40,690 --> 00:00:45,790
over-the-culture antihistamine medication have been shown

00:00:45,790 --> 00:00:49,890
to be helpful for those people with breast cancer.

00:00:49,890 --> 00:00:52,990
It can be helpful for anybody with any cancer,

00:00:52,990 --> 00:00:54,990
but certainly with breast cancer.

